   "detailed_description": "<h1>Expansion Pass 2 - Last Chance</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/394360/extras/bb9c027183452a6dd756a41d42b8f0a7.avif?t=1791468228\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/394360/extras_big/bb9c027183452a6dd756a41d42b8f0a7.avif?t=1791468228 width=1560 height=3250 /></span></p></p><br><h1>關於此遊戲</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >在大型戰略戰爭遊戲<i>《Hearts of Iron IV》</i>中，掌控歷史上強大無比的戰爭機器，考驗自己的戰略能力和政治洞察力。扮演當時的國家元首，建立一個工業強國並與他國形成外交同盟，準備好向敵對意識形態的國家發動戰爭，重寫第二次世界大戰的歷史。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/394360/extras/341d0dfa9d3af33efbc688cf6775a82d.poster.avif?t=1791468228\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/394360/extras/341d0dfa9d3af33efbc688cf6775a82d.webm?t=1791468228\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/394360/extras/341d0dfa9d3af33efbc688cf6775a82d.mp4?t=1791468228\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>《Hearts of Iron IV》</i>不僅是一款歷史模擬遊戲。您所做的每一個決定，小自在哪裡發動攻擊來突破歐洲堡壘、大至是否重建民主國家或早已為人所遺忘的君主國家，幾乎都會開闢不同的歷史路線。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/394360/extras/56b41def9854098a315e3ebf63728ae5.poster.avif?t=1791468228\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/394360/extras/56b41def9854098a315e3ebf63728ae5.webm?t=1791468228\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/394360/extras/56b41def9854098a315e3ebf63728ae5.mp4?t=1791468228\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >在<i>《Hearts of Iron IV》</i>中，您可以鉅細靡遺地規劃軍事戰略，為軍隊設計編制、研究新的生產模式和破壞手段、制定工廠指令及追求政治目標。戰爭的所有層面您幾乎都能影響，帶領您所選擇的國家度過人類最黑暗的時刻。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >本購買項目包含《Hearts of Iron IV》主遊戲以及四個擴展內容套件：</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >《Death or Dishonor》：著重於東歐和中歐的中等強國</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >《Together for Victory》：著重於大英國協國家</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >《Waking the Tiger》：著重於中國和日本</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >《Man the Guns》：以海軍功能和美國的架空歷史為主軸</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/394360/extras/a9040644809014f3864a353b30ab2229.poster.avif?t=1791468228\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/394360/extras/a9040644809014f3864a353b30ab2229.webm?t=1791468228\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/394360/extras/a9040644809014f3864a353b30ab2229.mp4?t=1791468228\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
   "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >在大型戰略戰爭遊戲<i>《Hearts of Iron IV》</i>中，掌控歷史上強大無比的戰爭機器，考驗自己的戰略能力和政治洞察力。扮演當時的國家元首，建立一個工業強國並與他國形成外交同盟，準備好向敵對意識形態的國家發動戰爭，重寫第二次世界大戰的歷史。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/394360/extras/341d0dfa9d3af33efbc688cf6775a82d.poster.avif?t=1791468228\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/394360/extras/341d0dfa9d3af33efbc688cf6775a82d.webm?t=1791468228\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/394360/extras/341d0dfa9d3af33efbc688cf6775a82d.mp4?t=1791468228\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>《Hearts of Iron IV》</i>不僅是一款歷史模擬遊戲。您所做的每一個決定，小自在哪裡發動攻擊來突破歐洲堡壘、大至是否重建民主國家或早已為人所遺忘的君主國家，幾乎都會開闢不同的歷史路線。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/394360/extras/56b41def9854098a315e3ebf63728ae5.poster.avif?t=1791468228\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/394360/extras/56b41def9854098a315e3ebf63728ae5.webm?t=1791468228\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/394360/extras/56b41def9854098a315e3ebf63728ae5.mp4?t=1791468228\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >在<i>《Hearts of Iron IV》</i>中，您可以鉅細靡遺地規劃軍事戰略，為軍隊設計編制、研究新的生產模式和破壞手段、制定工廠指令及追求政治目標。戰爭的所有層面您幾乎都能影響，帶領您所選擇的國家度過人類最黑暗的時刻。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >本購買項目包含《Hearts of Iron IV》主遊戲以及四個擴展內容套件：</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >《Death or Dishonor》：著重於東歐和中歐的中等強國</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >《Together for Victory》：著重於大英國協國家</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >《Waking the Tiger》：著重於中國和日本</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >《Man the Guns》：以海軍功能和美國的架空歷史為主軸</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/394360/extras/a9040644809014f3864a353b30ab2229.poster.avif?t=1791468228\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/394360/extras/a9040644809014f3864a353b30ab2229.webm?t=1791468228\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/394360/extras/a9040644809014f3864a353b30ab2229.mp4?t=1791468228\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
   "short_description": "Victory is at your fingertips! Your ability to lead your nation is your supreme weapon, the strategy game Hearts of Iron IV lets you take command of any nation in World War II; the most engaging conflict in world history.",
   "supported_languages": "英文, 法文, 德文, 波蘭文, 葡萄牙文 - 巴西, 俄文, 西班牙文 - 西班牙, 日文, 簡體中文, 韓文",
   "reviews": "“Hearts of Iron 4 wields complexity like a swift armor division during the blitzkrieg, allowing it to serve the idea of layered, cerebral, strategic warfare instead of letting it needlessly bog down the experience.”<br>9/10 – IGN<br><br>“It captivates me because—imperfectly, impressionistically, and perhaps a little amorally—it lets me orchestrate the most titanic armed struggles in history, from the fussy economic details to the cut-and-thrust of mechanized warfare. There are other great strategic-level wargames out there. But I have never played anything like Hearts of Iron 4”<br>8.8/10 – PC Gamer<br><br>“For now, after many dozens of hours, I'm taking a break from Hearts of Iron 4. Not because I'm sick of it; quite the contrary, in fact. What I need to do is some serious reading, some careful planning on what my vision for the United States should be in 1936. And when I've done that planning — when I've formulated my character sheet, as it were — I have the utmost confidence that Hearts of Iron 4 will be ready for me to play a role in world affairs.”<br>8/10 – Polygon<br>",
